# T12: heavy assets that don't ship with the wall-art staging preview.
# - Coloring books/: separate product line, not shown on the staging site.
# - videos/: marketing videos, not on staging.
# - images/generated/: book-promo videos + coloring-book gen output (linked
#   from index.html marketing section — Ken accepts 404s on staging).
# - images/bundles/*/prints/*-{2x3,3x4,iso,master}.png: full-res print
#   sources + non-display crops. Only *-4x5.png and cover.png are rendered
#   by the shipped pages. Full-res masters are the PRODUCT (stored
#   separately, delivered on order); the PDF packager is only reachable
#   via Whop webhook, which staging does not have.
Coloring books/
videos/
images/generated/
images/bundles/*/prints/*-2x3.png
images/bundles/*/prints/*-3x4.png
images/bundles/*/prints/*-iso.png
images/bundles/*/prints/*-master.png
server/FORGE_PLAN-ETSY.md
